Orchestrator change: collect round usages in an array, then:

```ts
const roundUsages: Array<UsageMetadata | undefined> = [];
...
roundUsages.push(outcome.usage);
...
if (hooks?.afterModelResponse) await hooks.afterModelResponse(session, responseText, sumRoundUsage(roundUsages));
```

